Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:03.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.53,0:00:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来 鬼魂 鬼魂 鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, ghosty, ghosty, ghosty!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.45,0:00:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来 不管你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out, come out wherever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe in ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄像机拍到了鬼 灵魂摄影\N{\fnArial\fs30}The camera caught ghost in the film? Spirit photography.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为怨魂是怎么产生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think angry spirits are born?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.45,0:00:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法释怀 无法前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't let it go. They can't move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.53,0:00:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,停留在这里多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}They stood here for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都觉得空洞 害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all feel disembodied, scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还说鬼魂呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talking about ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.42,0:00:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.98,0:00:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗 她救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The darkness … she saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是联系在一起的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're bound, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.37,0:00:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她感谢了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thanked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢你什么 - 释放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For what? - Setting her free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉应该就是黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Amara is the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.26,0:00:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女孩身体里有魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The devil's in that girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.81,0:00:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉饿了 她正在长身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara's hungry. She's a growing girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有个古老的邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we have some ancient evil out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天都愈发强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}just getting stronger by the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.53,0:00:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要那个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子吃灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The child eats souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.94,0:00:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.44,0:00:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.57,0:00:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:01:00.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.32,0:01:07.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马萨诸塞州 福尔河）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲身来到这个房间感觉更恐怖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is way creepier in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.93,0:01:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓鬼特工队可捕捉不到那股愤怒的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghost facers can't capture the…rage vibes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.94,0:01:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们会看到什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think we'll see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.36,0:01:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我为什么要这间房吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why I got this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说有很多超自然现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's supposed to get the heavy paranormal action.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.75,0:01:36.47,Title,0,0,0,0,,现在我们变成《闪灵》了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we're in "The Shining."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.09,0:01:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.59,0:01:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她要来抓你了 - 别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's coming to get you. - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 有我在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.06,0:02:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不就为这个来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what we came here for, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,门就是松了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hinges are falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.69,0:02:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.48,0:02:44.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莉兹房间）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:02:58.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莉兹·波顿床铺早餐式旅馆博物馆 勿扰）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.81,0:03:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第11季第5集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.98,0:03:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到黑暗的位置了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't suppose you got a 20 on the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.38,0:03:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前还以为是查到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, I thought I had something earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.94,0:03:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,半个小镇突然发疯 到处袭人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half a town flipped their gourds and started attacking people,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.74,0:03:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果是因为吃了患了狂犬病的负鼠肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it turns out they'd eaten rabid possum meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.67,0:03:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道负鼠就是大老鼠吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, they do realize that possum is a giant rat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.27,0:03:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是有袋类动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a marsupial.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.14,0:03:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是重点 看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the point. Look, check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一对情侣在马萨诸塞州福尔河被人用斧子砍死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, "A couple was ax-murdered in Fall River, Massachusetts,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,案发地为 听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}at"… wait for it…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.66,0:03:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉兹·波顿床铺早餐式旅馆博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Lizzie Borden Bed and Breakfast Museum."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.93,0:03:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 床铺早餐式旅馆加博物馆吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A b&b and a museum. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.91,0:03:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不像黑店嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't sound like a tourist trap at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.45,0:03:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.44,0:03:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家旅馆是莉兹·波顿本人的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}the inn was Lizzie Borden's actual house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.19,0:03:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,1892年 她在那家里砍死了爸爸和她继母\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 1892, she hacked up her dad and stepmom there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.79,0:03:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少是据传如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or… or allegedly hacked them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.39,0:03:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被判了无罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was acquitted,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.03,0:03:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,余生一直生活在福尔河\N{\fnArial\fs30}ended up spending the rest of her days in Fall River.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.97,0:03:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却遭镇民的迫害\N{\fnArial\fs30}hounded and persecuted by the townspeople.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.54,0:03:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是报复杀人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're thinking revenge killing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么现在啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.70,0:03:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是哪个看多了杀人狂电影的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was probably just some psycho fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.94,0:03:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,变态粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's seen too many slasher flicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:04:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能吧 但旅馆门锁得好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be, But the inn was locked up,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人进出的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}no signs of entry or exit,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.50,0:04:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,六位住客\N{\fnArial\fs30}a half a dozen guests,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.67,0:04:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,无一人看到或听到人闯入\N{\fnArial\fs30}none of whom saw or heard any intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.82,0:04:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许凶手很厉害呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe the murderer was actually competent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.61,0:04:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我知道怎么回事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. I know what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.60,0:04:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟你对连环杀手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has something to do with your freaky fetish for…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.59,0:04:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪迷恋有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}for serial killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.81,0:04:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,算不上迷恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a fetish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来就想去看那栋房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've always wanted to see that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.08,0:04:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 死了两个人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, two people are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.07,0:04:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还死在莉兹·波顿家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Lizzie Borden's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.49,0:04:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有阿玛拉的线索 不如去看看嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got no leads on Amara. I say we check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 整个波顿家族都埋在福尔河\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, the entire Borden clan are buried in Fall River,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.74,0:04:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括莉兹本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}including Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.55,0:04:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想拿小卡怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to do about Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.83,0:04:38.56,Title,0,0,0,0,,他连看《火线》正看得欢呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's knee-deep in binge-watching "The wire."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.56,0:04:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚开始看第二季\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just started season 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.70,0:04:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 他一时半会儿是停不下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, he's not coming out any time soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.81,0:04:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:05:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,波顿旅馆 有什么可以帮您的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Borden b&b. How may I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.23,0:05:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉兹还有自己的娃娃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess now Lizzie Borden has her own doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.53,0:05:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯眼睛有点过头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, went a little overboard on the crazy eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.89,0:05:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 现在已经不是犯罪现场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's absolutely not a crime scene anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.80,0:05:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,房间已经清理干净了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the room's been cleaned,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.13,0:05:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你都不在那层楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're not even on the same floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.51,0:05:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要取消…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Th-there's no reason to canc…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.12,0:05:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家还对凶杀的事心有余悸 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}People still freaked out about the murders, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.66,0:05:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人则觉得刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some find it exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,二位有什么需要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.87,0:05:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们读到了惨剧的报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We'd read about the tragedy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.88,0:05:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个历史迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm a bit of a history buff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I just wanted to ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.40,0:05:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得凶案跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you think the killings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.25,0:05:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉兹·波顿有任何关系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}had anything to do with Lizzie Borden…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.87,0:05:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指她的鬼魂什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, her ghost, or whatever?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概就是个疯狂粉丝闯了进来 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably just some crazed fan broke in, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.59,0:05:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些问题很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are great questions, guys…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.41,0:05:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是住客问 我们一般就回答了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ones we usually answer for our paying guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.17,0:05:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.34,0:05:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mason!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.73,0:05:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘记取消面包店的订单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forgot to cancel the bakery order!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我招待客人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, I'm with customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.08,0:05:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,两百块的丹麦面包 结果没人吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}$200 worth of Danish and no guests to eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能吃点啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys can put away a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.27,0:05:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要从你的工资里扣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming out of your paycheck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.63,0:05:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.28,0:05:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟家人共事有时是挺难办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working with family can be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,20年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,二位选房间吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have your pick of rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就住那对情侣住的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take the one the couple was in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,死去的那对情侣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The deceased couple?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们大老远来见鬼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came a long way to see some ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.34,0:06:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿应该是最不安生的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We figured there's the most unrest there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.49,0:06:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在不租那个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we're not renting that room right now…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.61,0:06:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,出于敬意\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但早晚得恢复生意嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you got to get back on that horse sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.54,0:06:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真走运 我们刚重装了房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky. We redid the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.05,0:06:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我们是住客了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now that we are paying guests,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.03,0:06:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那晚有看到或听到什么不寻常的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you hear or see anything unusual that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.45,0:06:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们尖叫之前没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not till we heard the screams.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.23,0:06:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫妈妈留在楼下 自己跑了上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told mom to stay downstairs, and I ran up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 那个血啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.61,0:06:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那对情侣是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who was the couple?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.22,0:06:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是本地的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Local kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.43,0:06:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那姑娘没什么特别的 但那男的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, nothing special about the girl, but the guy…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.39,0:06:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是原波顿家族的后裔\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was a descendant of the original Bordens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.58,0:07:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道眼睛该往哪放\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where to put my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm gonna throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被花饰包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're surrounded by doilies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.83,0:07:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.44,0:07:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那旅馆老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you think the innkeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,坑我们之前也不说一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}might have mentioned this before he ripped us off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.67,0:07:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你得另找间房了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you're gonna have to get yourself another room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这原来是莉兹的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this was Lizzie's original room,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.25,0:07:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是不会让出去的 - 你四岁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and I'm not giving it up. - What are you, 4?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.99,0:07:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟网上对楼上房间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That jibes with what people online.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.38,0:07:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说相吻合\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been saying about the upstairs…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.66,0:07:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,空屋传来哭声 脚步声 灯光闪烁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crying in empty rooms, footsteps, buzzing lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.02,0:07:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,衣橱里没有暗格或密道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No secret panels or passageways in the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.88,0:07:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上最小的厕所没什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the world's smallest bathroom is clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.46,0:07:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is that smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.54,0:07:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是薰衣草花露水\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a lavender toilet water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓶装花露水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottled toilet water?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.59,0:07:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喷个什么劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you keep spraying it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:08:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想看看按的那个东东好不好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to see if the squeezy thing worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.97,0:08:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是当香水用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it was supposed to be a perfume or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.86,0:08:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我去旅馆其他地方看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm gonna go check out the rest of the inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.22,0:08:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下我一身奶奶味儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause now I got grandma all over me, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.05,0:08:49.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（闲人免进）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:33.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我在莉兹·波顿床铺早餐式旅馆博物馆幸存了一晚）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.15,0:09:44.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莉兹·波顿床铺早餐式旅馆博物馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.17,0:11:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉兹不在阁楼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no Lizzie in the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.85,0:11:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我找到一台自制电磁干扰机\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did find a homemade EMF generator.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那东西关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turned that beast off,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.85,0:11:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果呢 没有信号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what do you know… no more signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.12,0:11:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人震惊啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.07,0:11:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪烁的电灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The, uh, flickering lights…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟埋在墙里的计时器连着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wired to timers buried in the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.13,0:11:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.12,0:11:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and check out this baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.15,0:11:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖着音响系统呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Covering up our very own sound system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.77,0:11:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把这个从墙里搜了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, fished this out of the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.43,0:11:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,空屋的哭声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crying in empty rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.82,0:11:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有呢 跑步的脚步声\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's more… running footsteps,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.66,0:11:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,听不清的恐怖低语\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, creepy whispers you can't quite make out,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.86,0:12:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一声马桶冲水 那个没搞明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}one flushing toilet… not quite sure what that's about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.65,0:12:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方就是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole place is a hoax, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.95,0:12:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我说的 是家黑店\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a tourist trap, just like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.86,0:12:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们还是不知道那对情侣怎么被人砍死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but we still don't know how that couple got axed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.43,0:12:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手如何进出的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how did the killer get in and out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.25,0:12:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 不如我们边喝啤酒吃龙虾卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Why don't we sherlock that over a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.60,0:12:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,边破案 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a lobster roll, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.47,0:12:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得赶紧离开这间花饰棺材\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to get out of this doily coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.02,0:13:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.99,0:13:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,马德森警探 我是柯林斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective Madsen? Agent Collins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们之前还不是联调局的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't feds earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我搭档是卧底来调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, um, my partner and I were undercover.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.69,0:13:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前的案件的\N{\fnArial\fs30}investigating the original murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.38,0:13:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我妈妈被杀时你在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell were you when my mom was being…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.62,0:13:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾 坎普先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so very sorry, Mr. Kemper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.67,0:13:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到行凶的混蛋的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna find the son of a bitch who's doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚刚锁好门\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had just finished locking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.81,0:13:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅馆里只有他和坎普太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one was inside but him and Mrs. Kemper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.86,0:13:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,员工几小时前就回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Staff went home hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.55,0:14:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一起凶案也没有嫌疑人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no suspects for the first murders, either?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.91,0:14:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是盖布利尔探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm agent Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.31,0:14:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前看到附近有个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I saw a guy hanging around earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.51,0:14:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在拍照\N{\fnArial\fs30}snapping some photos,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.59,0:14:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟他说话时 他跑掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he ran away when I tried to make contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.99,0:14:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜 矮 胖 娃娃脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess… short, chunky, baby-faced?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.24,0:14:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.78,0:14:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是伦 人畜无害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Len. Total teddy bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.02,0:14:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是高中同学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to high school with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.14,0:14:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他超喜欢鬼魂之类的事 但他没坏心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obsessed with ghosts, but harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.15,0:14:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.62,0:14:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a real issue around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,据商会说 绝对是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the chamber of commerce, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.26,0:14:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.14,0:14:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会派个警官去伦那里录下口供\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll send an officer over to Len, get a statement from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧 你们挺忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? You guys got your hands full.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.44,0:14:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll, uh… we'll drop by.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.75,0:14:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多谢 - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - You betcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.31,0:14:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前没有任何闹鬼的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, so far we got squat that says ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们毫不沾边\N{\fnArial\fs30}or anything remotely us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.43,0:14:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许不是我们一般的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe it's not our usual kind of gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.75,0:14:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这是个连环杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we're dealing with a serial killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就开心了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you'd love that, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.30,0:14:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯林斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Collins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.19,0:14:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是马德森警探 又发生了一起案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Detective Madsen. There's been another victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.80,0:14:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 发生在邻郡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Accident next county.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天呐 - 我已经过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God. - I'm there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.67,0:15:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 多谢告知\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Thanks for letting me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.84,0:15:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一人死在斧子下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another ax vic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.47,0:15:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这起案件离旅馆好几英里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one miles from the b&b.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.88,0:15:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉兹离家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie left home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.99,0:15:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.90,0:15:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我去犯罪现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll take the crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.12,0:15:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去找伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take Len.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁发现的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who found the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.04,0:15:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,保姆在家带孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babysitter was home with the kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.62,0:15:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在车道上发现了爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}found dad in the driveway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.17,0:15:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.53,0:15:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.47,0:15:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到乔迪的爸爸在外面停了车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard Jordie's dad pull up outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.02,0:15:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后有人大喊了一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then there was this shout.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.09,0:15:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to look,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没看见人 就先看见血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I saw the blood before I saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.88,0:15:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为是有人洒了油漆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought someone had spilled paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.80,0:15:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那之前呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about before?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你注意到什么异常情况了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, did you notice anything out of the ordinary?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.49,0:15:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,声音 气味 任何细节都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sound, smell? There's no detail too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.04,0:15:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 跟往常一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it was like any other night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:15:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jordie. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.35,0:16:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.68,0:16:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 他一直在家里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he was inside the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人 我是联调局的柯林斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, um, Agent Collins with the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.97,0:16:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这不是个好时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand this is a terrible time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.44,0:16:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果可以 我想问你几个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you can manage, I would love to ask you a few…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得赶紧离开我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get out of my house is what you need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我可以明天再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Uh, we can do this tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.76,0:16:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.19,0:16:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到能在这儿看见她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't expect to see her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,得会享乐嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, got to live your bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.98,0:16:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个莉兹·波顿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you are a Lizzie Borden…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.23,0:16:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来粉丝都不足以形容你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think "fan" covers it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁杆粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}A…Superfan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.87,0:16:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是博物馆管理员\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-and curator.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.46,0:16:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚去旅馆就为了这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And is that what you were doing tonight at the b&b?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.55,0:16:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,做管理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curating?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.56,0:17:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.46,0:17:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦 你还是说实话好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Len, it's best just to go with the truth here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想拍张莉兹鬼魂的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I was trying to get a picture of Lizzie's ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.98,0:17:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时拿的是那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And is that what I saw you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 是维多利亚时代的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's, uh… it's what the Victorians used,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.03,0:17:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,专门拍鬼魂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for spirit photography.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.00,0:17:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用这玩意拍到什么鬼了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And have you captured any caspers on that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.32,0:17:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在莉兹家见到过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've seen Lizzie at her house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是一团纤弱灰色的阴影\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's this wispy, gray shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.31,0:17:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但拍却拍不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she never shows up on film.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.19,0:17:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我该改用高清相机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should go high-def.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not go inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.33,0:17:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在不再被允许进旅馆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not exactly allowed at the inn anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.26,0:17:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那么一小张限制令\N{\fnArial\fs30}There… there's a minor restraining order.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一张禁口令\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's a gag order not to…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.90,0:17:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许我谈起那张限制令\N{\fnArial\fs30}talk about the restraining order.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.78,0:17:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你是联邦探员嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're a federal agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.48,0:17:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别遮遮掩掩 伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buried the lead there a little, Len.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.82,0:17:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说那张限制令的事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you tell me about the restraining order?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是莉兹的155岁生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Lizzie's 155th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.65,0:17:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我订不到莉兹的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't get Lizzie's room,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.99,0:17:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就住进了地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I stayed in the basement…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.99,0:18:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,住了几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for a couple days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.05,0:18:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,几周 我又没打扰到谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weeks. I wasn't bothering anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.15,0:18:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 你对旅馆挺了解喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's safe to say that you know the inn pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.22,0:18:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚有没有觉得有什么古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did anything about tonight strike you as weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你敲窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just you banging on the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.52,0:18:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的聊天室开启了 - 天呐 糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your chat room is open. - Oh, god, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.07,0:18:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原定主持一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to lead a live chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.27,0:18:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于福尔河斧子杀人案的直播聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the ax murders in Fall River.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.88,0:18:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是莉兹新闻频道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not Lizzie CNN!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.64,0:18:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不知道怎么会有人那么想呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't know why anyone would think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.24,0:18:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就关掉 等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll close it down. Be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.85,0:18:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.24,0:18:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天四起斧子杀人案 毫无线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four ax murders in two days, no leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.85,0:18:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个小镇都慌了 像大清洗一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole town's panicking like it's the Purge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.53,0:18:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是整个小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not the whole town.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.55,0:18:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,平斯基太太对丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Pinski doesn't seem too broken up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.03,0:18:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,惨死在车道上似乎并不很伤心呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}over the fact that her husband was butchered in the driveway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.97,0:18:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到尸体了 她那是太震惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw the body. She's in shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.77,0:18:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也还是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.17,0:18:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们对丧亲的反应很奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}People have freaky-ass reactions to loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.15,0:19:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪看到这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个关于鬼魂的网站吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A site about ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.85,0:19:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,超自然网\N{\fnArial\fs30}Th-the paranormal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.29,0:19:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦 你真心是我见过的最不会撒谎的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Len, you might be the worst liar I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.57,0:19:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你是在哪见过这个标志的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where you've seen this symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.17,0:19:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以带你去警局 在那儿问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take you down to the station and ask you there,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那就得惊动当地警方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then we've got to involve the local police,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.34,0:19:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得你的限制令吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}your restraining order.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.45,0:19:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.91,0:19:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.72,0:19:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,几晚前 我在莉兹家外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was outside Lizzie's house a couple nights ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是想拍张她的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}t-trying to catch a picture of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.27,0:19:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚还以为你是…没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a second, I thought you were… never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.75,0:19:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是迷路了 还是住这家旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you lost or staying at the inn?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.68,0:19:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I were.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.33,0:19:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看莉兹砍死父母的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see where Lizzie axed her folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.71,0:20:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, you were looking at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.14,0:20:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少是一半的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.68,0:20:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德鲁·波顿的尸体就是在那儿发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where they found Andrew Borden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.64,0:20:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,瘫倒在客厅的沙发上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slumped over the couch in the sitting…room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.19,0:20:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你多大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Uh, how old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.97,0:20:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的莉兹啊 我最近在读她的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor Lizzie. I've been reading up on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.15,0:20:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她父母好糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her parents sucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.44,0:20:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I totally agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.99,0:20:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉兹完全被历史误解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie has been so misunderstood by history.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叔叔显然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty obvious her uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.29,0:20:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 更强的动机和机会 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- had the stronger motive and opportunity. - Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.58,0:20:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是莉兹砍死了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie definitely hacked them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.48,0:20:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看她的眼睛就知道 那是连环杀人犯的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see it in her eyes… serial-killer eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后我就赶紧撇下了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I ditched her quick after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.08,0:20:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也没告诉警方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you didn't tell the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.64,0:20:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 有限制令\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A"… restraining order.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.71,0:20:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二 我要说什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}"B"… what am I supposed to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.38,0:20:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大半夜跟个12岁姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hanging out talking murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.35,0:20:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起闲聊凶杀案吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a 12-year-old girl in the middle of the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.31,0:20:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候看到的标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where does the symbol come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.37,0:20:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她肩膀上\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had it on her shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.06,0:20:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道是个疤 还是胎记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if it was a scar or… or a birthmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.33,0:21:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那姑娘什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did this girl look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.24,0:21:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就姑娘样呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.91,0:21:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她叫这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what she said her name was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.18,0:21:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.41,0:21:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说她12了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said she was 12?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.06,0:21:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe a little younger, or older.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.16,0:21:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.65,0:21:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个离家出走的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a runaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.97,0:21:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道阿玛拉现在在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where Amara is now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.08,0:21:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还在镇上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she still in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.02,0:21:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 你找她做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Why are you looking for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.53,0:21:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我不能跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not at liberty to discuss that with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.97,0:21:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须告诉我 拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to tell me. Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.47,0:21:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I need to find her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.33,0:21:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.87,0:21:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会信我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.00,0:21:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.06,0:21:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}enjoy your Lizzie fest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.28,0:21:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.35,0:21:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没碰你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I never touched you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.17,0:22:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道那女孩对我做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what that girl did to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.80,0:22:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那之后我一直不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I haven't been right since.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.98,0:22:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吃不下 睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't eat or sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.14,0:22:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.35,0:22:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前喜欢的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all the things I used to love…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.35,0:22:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的莉兹博客 鬼魂大会\N{\fnArial\fs30}my Lizzie blog, the ghost conventions…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.40,0:22:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,都让我毫无感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}they leave me cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.95,0:22:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨晚把整个收藏都摆上了易趣网\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I put this whole collection on ebay last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.28,0:22:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在都归俄亥俄州一个机械工了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it belongs to some machinist in Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.67,0:22:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是享乐的铁杆粉管理者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what about the superfan curator living the bliss?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.63,0:22:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是在扮演从前的我而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just playing the part of what I used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.70,0:22:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,装到成真嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, fake it till you make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.34,0:22:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者到有感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.77,0:22:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚去旅馆就是为了这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, is that what you were doing at the inn tonight…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.03,0:22:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faking it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.67,0:22:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.03,0:22:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是去找阿玛拉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking for Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.52,0:23:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让她把我恢复过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want her to put me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.85,0:23:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都…不合群\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always been…odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.19,0:23:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and quirky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.58,0:23:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我至少还有份生活 有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I had a life, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.67,0:23:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我还记得怎么跟人说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I remember how to talk to people,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.36,0:23:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,该说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.12,0:23:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我感觉好像在演戏一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I feel like I'm acting,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.94,0:23:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是在走过场\N{\fnArial\fs30}going through the motions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.42,0:23:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就像个机器人木偶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm like a robot puppet man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.42,0:23:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉来过 怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Amara was here? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.61,0:23:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,更疯狂的是 她现在12了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and the real crazy… apparently, she's like 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.61,0:23:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 这怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? How is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.24,0:23:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且她吃的不是小麦干\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't wheaties she's eating. I'll tell you that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.56,0:23:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.12,0:23:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦 他状况不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Len… he ain't doing so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.78,0:23:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得阿玛拉吸食了她的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Amara sucked out his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.60,0:23:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉在像草一样疯长吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}So, Amara's growing like a radioactive weed?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.13,0:23:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 因为她在大吃灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, by stuffing her face with souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.21,0:24:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么她的力量也更强了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that mean she's gaining more power, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.19,0:24:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.84,0:24:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 那个我们是躲不掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. That tsunami's gonna hit us sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.59,0:24:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我们只能对付我们能对付的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now we've got to deal with what we can deal with…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.03,0:24:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉留下的这些空壳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these spent shells Amara's leaving behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.90,0:24:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会觉得伦是那个斧子狂人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think Len's our Lizzie Borden, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.81,0:24:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我问过他的邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I-I talked to his neighbors,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.65,0:24:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了在旅馆被我碰见\N{\fnArial\fs30}and except for me seeing him at the b&b,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.71,0:24:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他整晚都在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's been here all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.65,0:24:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能杀他 他还没干过坏事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we can't kill him 'cause he hasn't done anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.04,0:24:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我们也不想杀他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we don't…want to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.20,0:24:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是想救人的 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to save people, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.51,0:24:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你的新规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, your new rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.47,0:24:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么还没杀人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why hasn't he offed anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.64,0:24:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜走下楼梯的光景\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it took Jenna all of walking downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.42,0:24:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就决定去割她奶奶喉咙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to slit her grandmother's throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.73,0:24:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 或许不是每个被吸干灵魂的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe not everybody Who gets their soul sucked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.46,0:24:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会变成杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}turns into a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.91,0:24:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他是还没来得及\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe he just hasn't gotten around to it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.79,0:24:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我想我们最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, I think the best thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.40,0:24:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯紧他 直到想到解决办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}we just stick close until we figure out how to help him out,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.71,0:24:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过首先 你得告诉他 他没魂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which starts by you telling him he's got no soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.53,0:24:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.13,0:24:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭什么是我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I have to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.59,0:24:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你经历过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, because you've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.38,0:24:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能理解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak the language.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.22,0:24:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还不知道自己被吸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't even know he's been hoovered yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.77,0:24:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你跟他关系比我好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but you have a better relationship with him than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.61,0:24:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你更会说话安慰人什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but you're better with that whole sensitive verbal massage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.10,0:24:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怎么「安慰」地跟人说\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no sensitive way to tell somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.48,0:24:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的灵魂被一个史前恶魔吸干了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}their soul has been sucked out by a prehistoric tween!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.93,0:25:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算伦真信我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even if Len does believe us,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.63,0:25:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那难道会让他感觉好点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that supposed to make him feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.17,0:25:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.92,0:25:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他大概也承受不住真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably couldn't handle the truth, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.00,0:25:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在有点脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a little… little fragile right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.88,0:25:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那好 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.37,0:25:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们要看护一个30岁大老爷们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we're babysitting a 30-year-old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.41,0:25:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉可能还吸了一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There may be someone else Amara got to, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.39,0:25:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斧子杀人狂 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Our hatchet man. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.87,0:25:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶案就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the murders started.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.69,0:25:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在伦看到阿玛拉之后开始的 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}right around the time Len saw Amara, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.92,0:25:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一位被害人的妻子 唐恩·平斯基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the wife of the last victim… Dawn Pinski…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.80,0:25:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到丈夫被杀时\N{\fnArial\fs30}had this bizarre reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.55,0:25:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,反应很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hearing her husband got minced.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.43,0:25:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她根本毫不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, like she couldn't care less.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.84,0:25:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没魂的时候就是那个感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's kind of the way I felt the whole time I was soulless.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.30,0:25:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你当时就是个冷血机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, you were one chilly droid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.61,0:25:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 警探认为她是受了惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyways, detective thinks it's shock,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.70,0:25:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想 或许妈妈没了魂 拿起了斧子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think maybe mom lost her soul and picked up an ax.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.47,0:25:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.31,0:26:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德妮 我是柯林斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sydney. This is Agent Collins.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.71,0:26:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想找平斯基太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trying to find Mrs. Pinski.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.80,0:26:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道她可能去哪了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea where she might be?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.79,0:26:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. She, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.00,0:26:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没说什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}she didn't mention anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.61,0:26:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐恩今天让我不用去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn didn't want me to come over today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.35,0:26:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德妮 你现在卷入了一起联邦案件的调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sydney, you are a part of a federal murder investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.43,0:26:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好别对我们有任何隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not want to hold anything back from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.07,0:26:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 有个地方 她可能去了那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, there might be one place that she could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.98,0:26:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐恩有个朋友…叫奈特…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn has a friend … Nate …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.54,0:26:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个特别的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}a special friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.10,0:26:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我懂你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm reading your mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.39,0:26:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不想害唐恩惹上麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't want to get Dawn in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.11,0:26:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道地址吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have an address?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.39,0:26:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,喵星人视频 鸡肉和华夫饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kitten videos, chicken and waffles,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.89,0:26:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,桉树香水 这些都不能激起我的兴趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}eucalyptus scent … don't care for it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.73,0:26:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经很迷黑卷发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to swoon for dark, curly hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.31,0:26:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…也不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now … not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.71,0:26:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我是中风了吗 还是长了脑瘤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I had a stroke? Or maybe it's a brain tumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.74,0:26:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正诡异的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's really freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.42,0:26:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是所有以前会让我起鸡皮疙瘩的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}is all the stuff that used to make my skin crawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.97,0:26:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今看来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}now seems…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.82,0:26:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前都不能和人握手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't shake a guy's hand before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.45,0:26:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 那湿乎乎的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, that wetness.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.19,0:26:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我可以舔掉陌生人身上的汗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I could lick the sweat off a stranger's …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.05,0:26:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行了 - 真的 舔身上任何一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Yeah, any body part.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.13,0:26:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 我觉得好奇怪 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious. I-I feel weird, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.32,0:26:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么个奇怪法\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Weird" how?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.77,0:27:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是…有东西正在我体内孵化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, something's hatching inside of me …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.76,0:27:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}something dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.79,0:27:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还长了…翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}with…wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.58,0:27:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.73,0:27:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你看了萨姆一眼 像是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But … no, you looked at Sam like …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.02,0:27:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道我出什么问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you guys know what's wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.51,0:27:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没灵魂了 明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have a soul, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.02,0:27:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉把你的灵魂吸走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara sucked it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.71,0:27:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.63,0:27:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.42,0:27:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不要更直接了当一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to be a little more blunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.76,0:27:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-how is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.02,0:27:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是为了避免你惹上麻烦 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this is just so you don't get in trouble, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.83,0:27:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be right back,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.50,0:27:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们再考虑该拿你怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we'll figure out what to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.83,0:27:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么拿回…我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how do … how do I get it back … my soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.12,0:27:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般来说 是拿不回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Generally, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.71,0:27:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于知道了感觉还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It feels good to finally know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.82,0:27:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.56,0:28:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.34,0:28:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝车是妈妈的 我昨晚看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the blue car's the mom's. I saw it last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.88,0:30:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jordie?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.67,0:30:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.88,0:30:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.23,0:30:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.75,0:30:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Oh, thank god.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.94,0:30:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.10,0:30:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信自己把你俩都抓住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe that I bagged both of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.13,0:30:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 所以是希德妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so it's, uh, Sydney,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.66,0:30:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀手保姆 不是妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}the killer babysitter, not the mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.91,0:30:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the story?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.37,0:30:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备像砍死其他人那样砍死我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna hack us up like the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.38,0:30:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不玩那套了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm … I'm past that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.66,0:30:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩是我给我新朋友的祭品\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are an offering to my new friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.96,0:30:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.08,0:30:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的新闺蜜是阿玛拉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is your new bestie Amara?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.97,0:30:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.12,0:31:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是嘛 我们关系可铁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, we're tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.26,0:31:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩怎么碰上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you two meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.54,0:31:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,几晚前 我喝得烂醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple nights ago, I got pretty sloshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.40,0:31:11.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莫莉的小斧屋）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.20,0:31:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个自以为是的 做信托基金的人渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, uh, smug, little trust-fund dirtbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.79,0:31:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我甩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}just dumped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.56,0:31:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 醉妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me? Drunk girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.90,0:31:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该开车的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.48,0:31:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会把头伸出窗外\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could put your head through a window.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.14,0:31:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父母呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, where are your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.82,0:31:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们居然在工作日晚上带你来这种破地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}They bring you to this dump on a school night?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.25,0:31:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸妈也这么干过\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents used to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.36,0:31:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是自己找到这地方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found this place on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.92,0:31:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢黑暗的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like dark places.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.06,0:31:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是一个人来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.01,0:31:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.77,0:31:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我送你上车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's get you inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.93,0:31:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我叫希德妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sydney, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.59,0:31:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮助你的 希德妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to help you, Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.16,0:32:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我需要帮助吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I need help?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.11,0:32:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, um, maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.03,0:32:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少今晚需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.18,0:32:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.49,0:32:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.80,0:32:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I feel like…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.80,0:32:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉像是摇头丸高潮巧克力蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like ecstasy-orgasm chocolate cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.96,0:32:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.46,0:32:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看着像个长翅膀的唠叨鬼马屁精吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like a whiny, winged suck-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.70,0:32:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.75,0:33:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看过一个冰茶广告吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you guys ever seen the iced-tea commercial.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.75,0:33:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有个女的躺在橡皮筏上\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the lady is lying on the inflatable raft,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.91,0:33:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在闪闪发光的池子里漂着\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she's just drifting along a sparkling pool?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.00,0:33:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是和阿玛拉在一起的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what it was like being with Amara …
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.35,0:33:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,极乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.94,0:33:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有伤痛 没有悲伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hurting, no sadness,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.33,0:33:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}no memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.11,0:33:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想要记忆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't want memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.45,0:33:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有对好父母吗 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have nice parents, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.45,0:33:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为在我爸妈眼中 我和我妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because my folks treated me and my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.91,0:33:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是人肉烟灰缸\N{\fnArial\fs30}like human ashtrays.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.62,0:33:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经喝酒麻痹自己 就因为不敢看伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to have to drink myself blind to even look at these,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.80,0:33:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别说给别人看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}let alone show anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.15,0:33:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而如今 我不知道阿玛拉对我做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I don't know what Amara did to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.78,0:33:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这只是皮而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's just skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.25,0:34:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧…那真是…恭喜你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, well, that's really…good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.01,0:34:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不会从噩梦中惊醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more waking up screaming from nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.72,0:34:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,再不会回忆起过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more flashbacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.21,0:34:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉带走了痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara took away the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.64,0:34:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她点亮了我的内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}She lightened something in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.89,0:34:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你现在变成了斧子杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except now you're an ax murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.40,0:34:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm free.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.78,0:34:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我脑海中总会回荡着一个声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before, there was always this constant voice in my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.55,0:34:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你不可以那样做 那样不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You can't do that. It's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.05,0:34:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一你被抓住了怎么办「\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you get caught?"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.95,0:34:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在终于安静了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now it is quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.87,0:34:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只剩下我和我心中的渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is just me and what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.59,0:34:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而当你可以随心所欲做任何事时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you can do whatever you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.15,0:34:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不会被抓到\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't have to get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.90,0:34:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时 你就可以真正飞翔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you can really fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.76,0:34:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把旅馆那对情侣砍成肉酱时 也飞翔了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you flying when you diced up that couple at the inn?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.38,0:34:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我得知那个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I found out that that pus hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.04,0:34:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,又带了个女孩去开房时\N{\fnArial\fs30}was taking another girl to the B&B …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.43,0:34:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's his deal-closing move …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.77,0:34:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不要窝在家里伤心流泪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have to sit at home and cry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.86,0:34:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅馆老板的妈妈又怎么惹你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about the innkeeper's mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.63,0:34:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个老东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That piece of jerky …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.52,0:35:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她欠了我两周的薪水\N{\fnArial\fs30}she screwed me out of two weeks pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.23,0:35:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经幻想如何杀死她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to fantasize about killing her,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.41,0:35:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我梦想已成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now I am living the dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.07,0:35:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪你可以进出无阻\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's how you got in and out …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.89,0:35:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾在那里工作过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You worked there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.08,0:35:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就干了一夏天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for one summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.35,0:35:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪的父母呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Jordie's parents, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.74,0:35:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也欺负你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, did they screw you over, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.98,0:35:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我 是乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me. Jordie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.92,0:35:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.23,0:35:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸贩毒 妈妈犯贱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meth-dealing dad, slut mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.47,0:35:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是救了乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I saved Jordie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.70,0:35:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比他俩更能照顾好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna take better care of him than they ever did.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.45,0:35:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我们俩是祭品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you said that we were, uh … we were an offering.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.95,0:35:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要怎么把阿玛拉找来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how are you planning on bringing Amara here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.03,0:35:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我说那姑娘有手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me that girl's got a cellphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.89,0:35:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been praying,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.13,0:35:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她能听见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know that she can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.15,0:35:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.64,0:35:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她离我很近\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.96,0:35:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还没离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hasn't left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.18,0:35:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让她出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, bring her on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.35,0:35:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们追捕那贱人好几周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been hunting that bitch for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.20,0:35:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是女神\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a Goddess!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.79,0:36:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 我杀人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap. I just did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.92,0:36:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.00,0:36:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗就要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Darkness is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.66,0:36:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是那么平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.36,0:36:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它来找我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.94,0:37:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪 你有什么亲戚家可以去借住吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Jordie, you have any, uh, family you can stay with?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.48,0:37:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我六个月大时 我妈妈就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was 6 months old, my mom died,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.25,0:37:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my dad was…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.76,0:37:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎不怎么陪在我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}was never really around much.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.74,0:37:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这与你相比不算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realize that's nowhere close to what you've lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.50,0:37:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但…你是能渡过难关的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but…You're gonna survive this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.98,0:37:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都会来帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are gonna help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.03,0:37:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个凯茜姨妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's aunt Kathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.17,0:37:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她圣诞节时会过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She comes at Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.07,0:37:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我是把手直接从手铐里挣出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}First of all, I ripped my hand out of the cuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.04,0:37:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我们 伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you saved us, Len.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.51,0:38:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我自残的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's not why I mauled myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.19,0:38:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想看看我能不能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I wanted to see if I could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.49,0:38:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是疼死个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hurt like a mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.60,0:38:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我并没有崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it didn't wig me out at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.16,0:38:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把自己的拇指捡起来 就跟捡迷你热狗肠一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I picked up my thumb like it was a mini hot dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.12,0:38:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦 说实话 这有点让人担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Len, I'm not gonna lie. That's worrisome.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.81,0:38:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that girl …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.19,0:38:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的大脑说 我应该去帮你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brain said I should help you,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.21,0:38:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我真的一点感觉都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I-I didn't really feel anything…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.13,0:38:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是对你或她\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you or her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.87,0:38:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的人会杀死人还毫无感觉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of person can murder and feel nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.12,0:38:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦 无论你内心有多少黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Len, whatever Darkness you have inside you,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.85,0:38:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你还有一丝良知\N{\fnArial\fs30}if there's a shred of conscience,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.84,0:38:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就还有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}then there might be hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.56,0:38:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 萨姆说灵魂一旦失去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sam said once your soul is gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.26,0:38:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就再也回不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't get it back, and …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.48,0:38:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很确定 如果没人阻拦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I-I know for sure now if I'm not stopped,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.60,0:38:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会继续杀人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}there'll be another kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.96,0:38:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.55,0:39:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像泡泡在上升\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a bubble rising up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.61,0:39:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.45,0:39:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.26,0:39:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't … I…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.52,0:39:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't want to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.07,0:39:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只有一个办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there's only one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.55,0:39:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去自首\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna turn myself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.98,0:39:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会担下所有的凶案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll confess to all the murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.76,0:39:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我就出不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way, I can't get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.61,0:39:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's not too many…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.81,0:39:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没灵魂的杀手会去自首\N{\fnArial\fs30}soulless killers that would give themselves up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.67,0:39:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得做正确的事是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember what it was like to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.64,0:39:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以趁我还能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm … I'm going through the motions.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.03,0:39:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就继续走过场吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}for as long as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.08,0:39:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢相信伦居然自首了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I can't believe Len turned himself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.89,0:40:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实这样也说得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it kind of makes sense, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.49,0:40:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去灵魂的人会有不同的反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}people having different reactions to losing their souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.83,0:40:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.49,0:40:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有自己的经历 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's got their own history, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.44,0:40:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦失去了心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Len loses his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.01,0:40:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德妮失去了头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sydney loses her head.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.58,0:40:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来是什么 胆小的狮子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we looking for, the cowardly lion next?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.92,0:40:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 每次我一想到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I get this, like, pit in my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.23,0:40:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的胃就会痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}any time I think of her …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.01,0:40:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Darkness …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.97,0:40:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是什么 她对人做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, we only know the tip of what she is,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.25,0:40:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只看到冰山一角\N{\fnArial\fs30}what she does to people.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.05,0:40:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦被她吓得惊慌失措\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Len was freaked out by her,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.53,0:40:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但希德妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Sydney …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.67,0:40:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德妮却欲罢不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sydney couldn't get enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.20,0:40:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说是极乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}The…bliss she was talking about, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.37,0:40:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说是什么样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it like for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.25,0:40:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和阿玛拉在一起时有那种感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you feel like that with Amara?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.93,0:40:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.70,0:40:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 那时很平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean, it was quiet,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.66,0:40:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, till, uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.40,0:40:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到她开始培养杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}till she started hatching killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.01,0:40:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,召集怪物组建军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}and rallying monsters to raise armies.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.12,0:40:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就只能这么找她了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's how we have to find her, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.08,0:41:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow the bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.63,0:41:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有更好的主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a better idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.01,0:41:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以追踪你看到的疯狂幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could follow the crazy you've been seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.88,0:41:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,按照阿玛拉的成长速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, at the rate Amara's growing,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.07,0:41:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处吸取灵魂 越来越强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}sucking souls and getting stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.11,0:41:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可能不会很难找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}she might not be that hard to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.33,0:41:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.21,0:41:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.79,0:41:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you soon.
